        <mxCell id="note" value="Level 0 collapses P1-P4 into one &quot;Lumine System&quot; process with the same 3 external entities (SAP, Sales Associate, Google Drive) — open with that, drill into this Level 1 only if asked. Processes verified against routers/upload.py (P1), services/task_scheduler.py (P2), routers/evidence.py (P3), routers/customers.py (P4)." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
